WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.850
Hey! Are you all right?

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.860
They've lost consciousness but they're still breathing.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:08.610
Yeah.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.190
What happened?

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.820
Their Tera was drained.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.370
I don't know how it happened, though.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.370
It seems that only the Mototsumitama and their contractees are unaffected.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.160
A large flow of Tera is traveling towards the Sacred Precincts.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.500
We need to investigate this.

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:27.500
But with that fog...

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.960
Yeah, we can't use the helicopter.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.920
You guys stay here.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.680
We'll check it out.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:42.350
Everything began in the Sacred Precincts.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.600
And now, something big is happening again in those lands.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.190
I wonder if this is destiny...

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:56.660
But I couldn't take my eyes away from the ocean where Akane-san vanished.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:08.710
"Masagami"

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.790
I'm returning to the Sacred Precincts.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.000
Kuro...

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.340
Princess, I will accompany you.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.340
Hey, what about those wounds?

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.670
I am fine. Please let me go.

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.180
Yakumo...

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.010
Please...

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.100
Kuro.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.060
Keita-san, please look for Akane-san.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:33.150
Thank goodness... you were safe, Keita-kun...

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:36.110
Even if Akane-san is alive...

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.820
...If you consider all this...

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:43.490
Right now... the best thing I can do...

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.080
Keita-san?

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.790
I'm going, too...

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:55.590
If this is destiny again, I'll overcome it.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.880
Together with my irreplaceable partner.

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.550
Together with you.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.760
Keita-san...

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.890
So you used to live here, Yakumo?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:49.890
Yes, but we lived closer to the summit.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:55.480
Since Kuro-chan is the princess, you're pretty important as well, right?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.150
Not really.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.070
I was just Reishin-sama's best disciple.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.200
The Reiseki is up there.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.380
Kuro...

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.790
Princess...

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.960
Don't mind me.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:22.970
Yakumo, don't you feel a little tired from walking so far?

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.600
I'm okay. Don't worry about me. Let's continue.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:35.730
It's all right, Punipuni. That bug was just scared.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.650
Best shot!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:47.160
Geez, Punipuni, don't get so angry just because we didn't help you immediately.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.060
This Tera I just sensed is...?

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.360
But...

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.200
Riona-san...?

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.210
Here...

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:39.460
I was so hungry, I couldn't sleep.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.760
You want some, Kuro-chan?

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:43.840
Can I?

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:45.970
Punipuni.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.430
Whew. Good thing it wasn't an enemy attack.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.690
Akane-san...

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:19.170
Yakumo, do you want some Joyjoy? It's very nutritious.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.250
I'm fine.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.340
A Mototsumitama!

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.010
Gross!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:32.810
Who are you?!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.520
You're not from the Sacred Precincts.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.560
And who might you be?

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.690
We're from the Shishigami Clan.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.520
And we're their contractees. Who are you?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:48.280
I am Namu and I've come to record history.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.370
Record history?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:54.040
Members of my clan through the ages were all historians.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.870
Historians?

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.410
I've heard about them before.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:03.550
There exists Mototsumitama in the main continent who constantly record the history of the world ever since it began.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:07.920
This is precisely the moment when history changes!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.260
I have come to record it.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.560
What do you mean, change?

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:27.440
Since incidents like the destruction of the Reiseki in Okinawa and the increased flow of Tera broke out,

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:31.570
I left the Sacred Precincts to come to Japan, the source of it all, to investigate.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:35.370
However, I had no money and was denied when I asked for airplane tickets.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:39.920
I had no choice but to smuggle myself in with the luggage. I somehow managed to reached Japan, but I was caught at the airport.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:43.670
T-That's not what we asked...

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:47.960
Yakumo... don't you find her suspicious?

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:51.840
But the overwhelming flow of Tera she emits shows that she isn't someone to be taken lightly.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:56.600
It seems all of the Reiseki across the world were destroyed at simultaneously.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.560
All the Reiseki across the world?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:07.610
I see. That's why the Tera that flooded out from all the Reiseki in the world is gathering here.

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.860
Why in the Sacred Precincts?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:13.990
Likely because the Reiseki here is the Reiouseki.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:14.990
Reiouseki?

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:18.870
A Reiseki that has a power sufficient enough to destroy the world sealed within it.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.870
Enough power to destroy the world?

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:27.380
The Reiouseki has the power of the Masagami sealed within it.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.380
Masagami?

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.630
You really don't know?

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:34.390
I don't.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:39.640
It's a god born from Tera when the world was created.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.520
From Tera?

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.150
The records state this:

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:50.280
When the world was no more than the sun, the land and the sea,

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:55.820
the Masagami, Mototsumitama and humans were born from Tera, the source of all life.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:08:04.290
At first, the three lived in different worlds. However, the Masagami yearned everything and intruded the other worlds.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:10.460
The Masagami took the harmony of nature away from the Mototsumitama and cut through the lands of the humans.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:17.350
But the humans have already finished forging out rivers, fields and even created alters for the various gods.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.310
The Masagami wanted to kill the humans and and take their Tera for themselves.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.350
For such unreasonable reasons...

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:27.560
They did whatever they wanted to do, snatched whatever they wanted and even went as far as to kill? That's horrible!

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:33.780
However, for the Mototsumitama, humans are life-forms that they needed to coexist with in the world.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:41.330
That's when both exchanged hearts to create contracts to fight against the Masagami together.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:48.340
That's when Mototsumitama and humans began forming contracts.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.340
The fight against the Masagami was intense.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:59.220
The Masagami went all out in destroying the world.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:03.680
They scorch the lands and froze the seas.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:08.020
The battle lasted for centuries before they were finally defeated.

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:13.650
That power was not just sealed by the Reiouseki, but with various other Reiseki as well.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:21.120
However, the Masagami refused do die and cast a curse on the humans before being sealed.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.370
Could that be the Doppeliner system?

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:29.880
Yes, the Masagami cursed the humans with a severe fate.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:37.720
I had no idea the Doppeliner system was a curse cast upon the humans.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:44.640
The Doppeliner system is a destiny created to torment humans...

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:51.980
We were taught as Mototsumitama that we should protect the balance of Tera and maintain the Doppeliner system.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.400
Why is that?

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:57.280
Once the number of Master Roots increases, the amount of Tera will start to become saturated.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:10:01.910
This will cause the power of the Masagami that is sealed within the Reiouseki to revive.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.080
Revive?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:11.460
The one who obtains this fearsome power of the Masagami can become the destroyer of the world.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.550
The destroyer of the world, huh?

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.800
Who are you?

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.930
Aragi, from the Ginko clan.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:21.850
The Ginko clan?

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:23.430
The same clan as Mikami?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.140
Mikami?

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:28.140
Oh, that bitch.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.980
Do you know her?

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:32.690
We've fought loads of times...

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:37.070
Well, I never lost against her though...

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:42.450
So you've come this far to obtain the power of the Masagami?

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:48.460
It's not just us. There's another guy after the power of the Masagami.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.210
Another guy?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:57.960
I never thought you would still be alive, Shishigami Reishin.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:03.350
Considering you defeated Steiner, I take it you won't go down easily.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.610
I won't give the power of the Masagami to anyone.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:17.150
It's going to be mine!

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.150
I won't allow that!

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:21.820
I'll eliminate all who decide to get in my way.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.320
Sora, let's synchro!

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.120
Okay, Aragi.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.160
Synchro!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.710
Kuro, let's synchro!

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:38.920
Okay!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:45.800
Synchro!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:03.070
The Tera is cycling. Is that even possible?

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:04.910
Riona-san we should also...

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.660
No, you're in no condition to fight yet.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:12.000
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:16.330
There are crests on both hands? How interesting.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.050
It seems that there's some meaning in this battle.

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.090
Don't let your guard down, Kuro.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:23.340
Okay!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:24.930
Princess!

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:28.100
There's an interesting fight, so don't spoil it.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.350
Please let me go!

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.390
Sora, use your Thousands.

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.350
Okay.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:36.190
Gravi-doom!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:39.860
What's this?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.480
My body feels heavy...

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:46.360
How does it feel? You don't get to experience something like this very often, right?

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:49.990
The Thousands' power?

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:54.500
My Thousands can freely control the gravitation acceleration within a given radius.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.170
I can increase the acceleration further, too.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.630
My body...

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.260
It feels like it's about to crumble.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.800
Surprised?

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:10.390
I've been trained under this gravity, you see?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.020
This is a walk in the park...

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.020
Is the victor decided?

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:18.900
Princess!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.690
Why are you stopping me?!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:26.490
You've already been told that you're useless in that condition...

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:31.990
If you have that much Tera, then fight! You even have that weapon.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:35.830
I'm not allowed to interfere with history.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.250
I only record what happens.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.210
What's with that...?

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.300
If only I had a Thousands...

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.420
Really gross!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.930
Damn it! I can't move!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:58.190
It's pointless.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.440
How's that? It packs quite a punch, doesn't it?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:11.950
In this gravitational field, attacks from below are halved and attacks from above are doubled.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:17.710
In other words, if you don't make use of the gravitational acceleration, it's useless!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.840
Kuro!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:28.970
A fairly capable Thousands, but my fists are stronger.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.720
If that's so...

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:36.220
What are you aiming at? Are you trying to kill your partner?

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:37.850
No, not quite...

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.730
Kuro, from above!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:40.480
Okay!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.690
Exceed,

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.150
Megaexe!

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:51.160
All right!

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:57.160
Indeed, attacks from above double the power.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.330
She really is...

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:02.920
But, it couldn't be... It's impossible...

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:04.540
What do you mean?

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:05.920
Nevermind.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.970
It's been a while since I took such a good hit.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.680
What a tough bastard.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.680
Which clan are you from?

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:19.430
I'm from the Shishigami clan.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:20.940
What?!

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:24.690
Could you be the Shishigami princess?

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.440
I see...

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.240
Exceed,

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.030
Juumasou!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.460
This is the first time that Aragi got serious ever since the fight with Mikami.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:48.130
Within this gravity field, there hasn't been anyone who was able to last over one minute while facing this Exceed!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:53.720
He's fast!

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:56.720
This is bad. If this keeps up, Kuro is going to...

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:00.220
Next, I will squash your body into bits!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.110
Sora!

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.860
Thank you, Keita-san!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.160
All right! Go!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.370
Okay!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.910
Exceed,

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.740
Megaexe!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:25.540
Such a weak Exceed inside the gravity field won't...

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.540
Kuro! Keep the pressure on!

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.500
Okay!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.380
Exceed,

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.590
Gigaexe!

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.060
They did it!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.700
Wow... That's the Shishigami Princess for you...

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:05.500
Will you and Reishin, together, obtain the Masagami's power?

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.210
Aragi!

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:10.590
Reishin?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.920
I knew it... My brother is here...

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.720
He didn't die?

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:22.220
Ever since I've returned to the Sacred Precincts, I've felt my brother's Tera.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:35.400
Damn it! Why won't he run out of Tera?

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:42.240
June, when this battle is over, would you like to go to Nice?

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.750
Proposing, now of all times?

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:58.760
Exceed, Dread Bullet!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.160
Did we get him?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.200
I can't tell yet... Don't drop your guard...

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:41.970
Bernhard!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.110
It's full...

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:04.120
Finally, the time has come.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.120
What's wrong, Kuro?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:10.500
I can feel my brother's Tera.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.880
Either I wasn't wrong, or it wasn't just me

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:16.300
Then Reishin is really here, right?

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.420
Yes, I can feel him, too.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:22.180
Is Reishin after the Masagami's power, too?

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:24.140
I will definitely not allow that!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:27.680
Is Reishin heading toward the Reiouseki?

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:28.390
It's likely.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.390
Let's go to where he is.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:38.860
But can we really defeat Reishin...?

